{"id":10339,"bangumiId":10339,"type":2,"name":"青の祓魔師","name_cn":"青之驱魔师","date":"2011-04-17","year":"2011","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg"},"summary":"青之驱魔师所写的世界由两个空间组成，并像镜般连为一体。人类居住的物质界为本作舞台，另外还有恶魔居住的虚无界。平常基本上无法接触或穿梭于两界之间。可是恶魔能凭依于相当的物质从而进入人类的世界。撒旦乃众魔之神，为了从人间捡回一个能抑制他的箱子，而诞下了奥村磷——他跟一人界女子的儿子。可是撒旦的密谋未能得到到磷的认同。及后撒旦更杀掉了磷的监护人养父，并要带磷返去虚无界。这使磷开始了驱魔师之旅，就为了打败他的生父撒旦。","rating":{"rank":2347,"total":7002,"count":{"1":17,"2":17,"3":37,"4":117,"5":433,"6":1466,"7":2480,"8":1731,"9":377,"10":327},"score":7.1},"collection":{"on_hold":808,"dropped":535,"wish":1887,"collect":9457,"doing":1996},"tags":[{"name":"青の祓魔師","count":1555,"total_count":1780},{"name":"兄弟","count":974,"total_count":1681},{"name":"热血","count":882,"total_count":218522},{"name":"2011年4月","count":758,"total_count":23946},{"name":"福山潤","count":630,"total_count":5236},{"name":"JUMP","count":560,"total_count":33690},{"name":"TV","count":452,"total_count":1443415},{"name":"神谷浩史","count":433,"total_count":30102},{"name":"花澤香菜","count":356,"total_count":6979},{"name":"恶魔","count":308,"total_count":1008},{"name":"2011","count":290,"total_count":53929},{"name":"冈本信彦","count":284,"total_count":1407},{"name":"尼桑","count":239,"total_count":243},{"name":"战斗","count":239,"total_count":488939},{"name":"漫画改","count":233,"total_count":891297},{"name":"A-1Pictures","count":226,"total_count":148215}],"eps":25,"total_episodes":25,"aliases":["青之驱魔师","青の祓魔師","青之祓魔师","蓝色驱魔师","青エク","Blue Exorcist","Ao no Exorcist"],"sourceType":"bibliography","nsfw":false,"annualRank":27,"sourceYear":2011,"sourceUrl":"https://bgm.tv/subject/10339","popularity":14683}